{"title":"1502.02398 Towards a Learning Theory of Cause-Effect Inference","markdown":{"headingText":"1502.02398 Towards a Learning Theory of Cause-Effect Inference","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"- 作者/日期/来源：David Lopez-Paz, Krikamol Muandet, Bernhard Schölkopf, Ilya Tolstikhin / 2015-02-09 / arXiv:1502.02398（ICML 2015）\n- **一句话定位**：把双变量因果方向判定重新表述为\"分布分类\"学习问题——用特征核的核均值嵌入（kernel mean embedding）把每个样本集 S_i 特征化，再训练二分类器区分 X→Y 与 X←Y，并给出该范式的一致性与学习速率理论，其实例化方法 RCC（Randomized Causation Coefficient）在当时达到最优经验性能。\n- **研究问题**：既有双变量因果方法（ANM、IGCI 等）各自依赖难以检验的特殊假设。能否构造数据驱动的通用因果推断规则，直接从带标签的 {(S_i,l_i)} 中学习\"因果痕迹\"（causal footprints），并回答其统计一致性与样本复杂度问题。\n- **模型与方法**：设存在\"母分布\"（Mother distribution）M 定义在 P×L 上（P 为因果对 (X,Y) 联合分布的集合，L={±1}）；从中抽 n 个分布 P_i 及标签，实际观测的是每个 P_i 的样本 S_i（两层嵌套采样）。特征化：用高斯核等特征核把 S_i 嵌入为经验核均值 µ_k(P_{S_i})=(1/n)Σk(z_i,·)（特征核下不损失信息）；分类器类 F_k 为 RKHS 上的泛函（如范数有界的线性泛函）。因果\"可识别性\"被翻译为 M 的性质：M(l|P) 确定时问题可识别、速率可达 O(n^{−1})；M 完全随机（如线性+高斯噪声情形）时不可识别。大数据扩展：用 Bochner 定理与随机傅里叶特征 (14) 把无穷维嵌入降为 m 维向量，配套 Theorem 6 的逼近误差界。多元情形：避免超指数多的 DAG 类，仿 PC 算法思想对每对 (X_i,X_j) 在所有语境 X_k⊆X\\{X_i,X_j} 下分类三种标签。实现 RCC：特征 ν(S)=(µ_{k,m}(P_{S_x}),µ_{k,m}(P_{S_y}),µ_{k,m}(P_{S_{xy}}))，三组多带宽随机特征（0.1γ,γ,10γ，中位数启发式），m=1000，随机森林分类。\n- **主要命题/定理**：Theorem 1：经验嵌入以 O(n^{−1/2}) 收敛到 µ_k(P)。Theorem 3（主结果）：在有界连续核（sup k(z,z)≤1）、F_k 的 Lipschitz 常数一致有界、代理损失 L_ϕ-Lipschitz 等假设下，以概率 ≥1−δ，超额代理风险 R̃_ϕ(f̃_n)−R_ϕ(f*) ≤ 4L_ϕR_n(F_k)+2B√(log(2n/δ)/2n) + (4L_ϕL_F/n)Σ√(E_{z∼P_i}[k(z,z)]+√(log(2n_i/δ)/2n_i))/√n_i；当 n,n_i→∞ 且 log n/n_i→o(1) 时趋于零（一致），n_i 方向的 O(n_i^{−1/2}) 速率不可改进。Theorem 4（下界）：存在普适常数使嵌入误差 ≥Cσ_{H_k}/√n 以常概率成立，证明 Theorem 1 速率是紧的。经验结果：Tübingen CauseEffectPairs 82对标量对上，RCC 全强制决策准确率 81.61%（SVM 版 77.2%），超过 IGCI 与 ANM；训练数据由一个参数化合成母分布生成、参数 θ 通过最小化与真实数据嵌入距离的直推式准则 (16) 选出。时间之箭（脑电信号，与 Peters et al. 2009 同数据）：准确率 82.66%，持平当时最优。ChaLearn 竞赛数据（N=16,199）：双向 AUC 0.74（第三名）；检测隐混杂准确率 80%，检测独立性 88%。autoMPG 与 abalone 数据上重建的多变量 DAG 给出了\"因果/反因果预测任务\"的划分。\n- **在因果研究脉络中的角色**：将因果方向判定从\"手工假设+可识别性证明\"范式转向\"元学习/分布分类\"范式，是后来因果表征元学习（如 2018 年后的 neural causal reasoning 一系）的直接先声，并为该范式建立了第一个严格的学习理论基础。\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":""},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":"auto","echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":null,"link-external-icon":false,"link-external-newwindow":false,"self-contained-math":false,"format-resources":[],"notebook-links":true},"pandoc":{"standalone":true,"wrap":"none","default-image-extension":"png","to":"html","output-file":"1502.02398.html"},"language":{"toc-title-document":"目录","toc-title-website":"该页面内容","related-formats-title":"其他格式","related-notebooks-title":"笔记本","source-notebooks-prefix":"资源","other-links-title":"其他链接","code-links-title":"代码链接","launch-dev-container-title":"启动 Dev Container","launch-binder-title":"启动 Binder","article-notebook-label":"文章笔记本","notebook-preview-download":"下载笔记本","notebook-preview-download-src":"下载源代码","notebook-preview-back":"返回文章","manuscript-meca-bundle":"MECA 存档","section-title-abstract":"摘要","section-title-appendices":"附录","